From 7313bb7f7f9d3d1790eb5dab639e58fc951413b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:46:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type network transport lifecycle and proxy
 diagnostics

Mechanically convert 24 related network/proxy producers with the existing
typed event API. Preserve original per-site category and severity, socket
errors, disconnect decisions, timeout units and expressions. Existing
fLogIPs conditionals and RedactWebSocketURL remain intact; do not expose
addresses when their original message suppressed them. Peer identities,
message types and byte/second counters use existing fields.

Leave the pre-existing SOCKS username/password debug producer unchanged and
flagged for separate privacy repair. This conversion adds no credentials,
new producer API, network behavior or negotiation/compatibility fallback.

Scripted-diff commands (at this commit parent):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/network-transport-lifecycle-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-network/network-transport-source.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/net.cpp src/netbase.cpp
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/net.cpp src/netbase.cpp
git diff --check

The reviewed rule catalog is the authored input. Exact AST rewrite, manual
diff review, scoped lint (93 production events), and whitespace pass.
Compilation and existing network/proxy tests: NOT RUN; one combined native
validation is deferred until final canonical composition and resource grant.

Native-V2-only P2PV2TransportDeserializer producers are deliberately placed
in the following separate native-V2 commit after framing owner 23a4dd0de4.
